"<html><head/><body><p>Use the Hue, Saturation, Luma model for the MyPaint "
"Shade Selector</p><p>Luma is similar to Intensity, except it weighs the red "
"green and blue components before adding them together. As such, Yellow is "
"brighter than Cyan. This model is exactly the same as MyPaint HCY'.</p></"
"body></html>"
